                    <p class="notebook-p coming-soon-regular">
                        <code class="notebook-p coming-soon-regular dotted">pow(i,(p-1)//2,p)</code> - Legendre Symbol 
                        <br>
                        <br>
                        Pentru a 2-a parte vom folosi faptul ca <br><strong>a<sup>(p−1)/2</sup> ≡ 1 </strong> <=> <span class="fw-bold font-red">/ · a</span><br>
                        <strong>a · a<sup>(p−1)/2</sup> ≡ 1 · a </strong> <=> <br>
                        <strong>a<sup>(p−1)/2 + 1</sup> ≡ a </strong> <=> <br>
                        <strong>a<sup>(p−1+2)/2</sup> ≡ a </strong> <=> <br>
                        <strong>a<sup>(p+1)/2</sup> ≡ a </strong> <br><br>

                        Din faptul ca <span class="fst-italic" style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.13);">the prime supplied obeys p = 3 mod 4</span> deducem ca p este de forma 4k + 3 si putem verifica ca numarul sa fie valid<br>
                        Inlocuindu-l pe p in <strong>a<sup>(p+1)/2</sup> ≡ a </strong> obtinem: <br>
                        <strong>a<sup>(4k+3+1)/2</sup> ≡ a </strong> <=> <br>
                        <strong>a<sup>(4k + 4)/2</sup> ≡ a </strong> <=> <br>
                        <strong>a<sup>2·(2k+2)/2</sup> ≡ a </strong> <=> <br>
                        <strong>a<sup>(2k+2)</sup> ≡ a </strong><br><br>

                        <strong>a<sup>(2k+2)</sup> ≡ a </strong><=> <span class="fw-bold font-red">/√</span><br>
                        <strong>a<sup>(2k+2)/2</sup> ≡ a <sup>1/2</sup></strong><=><br>
                        <strong>a<sup>k+1</sup> ≡ a <sup>1/2</sup> </strong>care este numar intreg<br><br>

                        Intr-un final putem aplica radicalul asupra
                        <strong>a<sup>(p+1)/2</sup> ≡ a </strong><=> <span class="fw-bold font-red">/√</span><br>
                        <strong>a<sup>(p+1)/4</sup> ≡ a <sup>1/2</sup></strong> <=> <br>
                        <code class="notebook-p coming-soon-regular dotted">pow(i,(p+1)//4,p)</code>
                    </p>
